   "evidence": "`ExclKinematics` at `DIS/Exclusive/Kinematics/Basic.lean:32` with `hMomentum : p + q = pPrime + qPrime` (line 52); `toExclKinematics` supplies `qPrime := pX K` and `hMomentum := p_add_q_eq_pPrime_add_pX K`, both proved by `abel` from the record fields alone (lines 140-142) \u2014 no diffractive hypothesis, no diffractive variable (`xi`, `beta`, `MX2`, `MY2`) appears in any of the listed declarations. `Q2_toExclKinematics` is `rw [ExclKinematics.Q2, DisKinematics.Q2, toExclKinematics_q]`, purely structural.",
